lines+=['','## Hackathon OpenAI path','', 'Added **GPT-6 Luna contours · experimental**, a direct image-to-polygons route independent of local detection. Returned masks remain editable and carry no invented confidence or food weight. Added **Research masks + OpenAI review · experimental** for the validation-selected local candidate with OpenAI label review; it is opt-in and does not replace the default. A live hybrid call and isolated API replay both passed. Fragmented plates send at most eight largest regions for cloud review; remaining regions stay editable and explicitly require manual review. The existing **Local + GPT-6 Luna label review** retains default local geometry and asks OpenAI to review the labels. These are distinct workflows.', '', 'Two fixed 24-image diagnostics tested the direct route. Changing from 0–1000 JSON-mode coordinates to an explicit full-image 0–1 strict schema improved parsing and localization. This is prompt development on a reused benchmark, not independent validation.', '', '| Direct Luna protocol | Valid responses | Chicken IoU, paired16 | Chicken recall | Chicken FP / 8 negatives |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
