lines+=['','Direct Luna contours remain experimental because false positives and boundary errors are substantial. Use the local + OpenAI label-review workflow and manual mask correction for the demonstration. Label review does not fix missed masks. See [HACKATHON.md](HACKATHON.md).', '', '## Budget and verification','',f'Run ceiling: **$3**. Accounted run cost: **${r["run_budget"]["accounted_usd"]:.6f}**. Cumulative accounted cost: **${r["accounted_total"]:.6f} / $5**. SQLite reservations enforce both limits atomically; unknown outcomes retain their reservation. No paid GPU or paid fine-tuning.', '', '34 automated tests passed, including the independent run ceiling, strict geometry validation, direct cloud routing without local masks, and detection-preserving refinement. The frontend production build passed. Live provider responses were tested separately; an isolated API smoke replay verified editing, confirmation, original prediction preservation, unknown grams, and exclusion of demo records from real analytics.', '', f'All v6-relative regression gates passed: **{r["all_regression_gates_pass"]}**. Failed checks:', '']
